cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these calculators, please cite the archived release you used,
  by its version DOI.
type: software
title: "NDIcalc-vis-matlab: NDI calculators for vision science"
abstract: >-
  Domain-specific analysis applets ("calculators") for vision science, built on
  the NDI framework: orientation and direction tuning, contrast tuning and
  contrast sensitivity, spatial and temporal frequency tuning, speed tuning,
  and Hartley reverse correlation. Each calculator searches a typed document
  database for its inputs, writes a single typed output document, and carries
  its own documentation, self-tests, default parameters, and plotting method.
